    <item>
      <title>曾经处于边缘地位的欧洲极右势力现在为西班牙移民危机定下了基调</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/world/europe/europe-migrants-ceuta.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[2015年，欧洲庇护了许多难民。它对休达新危机的强硬反应表明，11年后，极右翼势力如何重塑了欧洲的态度。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/world/europe/europe-migrants-ceuta.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 07:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普称他将取消对伊朗的打击，等待迅速达成协议</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/world/middleeast/trump-iran-cancels-attack-deal.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统表示，他同意伊朗和其他中东国家取消计划中的袭击的要求，并称在与德黑兰达成“协议范围”方面取得了进展。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/world/middleeast/trump-iran-cancels-attack-deal.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 07:02:40 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>大多数移民离开休达后，精疲力竭的坚守者在海滩上找到了庇护所</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/world/europe/ceuta-spain-morocco-migrant-holdouts-beach.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[周四涌入西班牙的大多数人此后已返回摩洛哥。一小部分人躲在海滨，又累又饿，并发誓要留下来。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/world/europe/ceuta-spain-morocco-migrant-holdouts-beach.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 05:17:45 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在掉落反光池案例中，皮罗引起了特朗普的愤怒</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/jeanine-pirro-trump-reflecting-pool.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[华盛顿美国检察官珍妮·皮罗 (Jeanine Pirro) 将其归咎于劣质建筑，这与特朗普总统钟爱的理论相矛盾。特朗普先生表示他“100%”不同意她的观点。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/jeanine-pirro-trump-reflecting-pool.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:49:27 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普林肯纪念堂倒影池改造传奇的时间表</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/reflecting-pool-trump-timeline.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统发誓要恢复华盛顿的标志性特征——倒影池。几个月后，它空了，不对公众开放。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/reflecting-pool-trump-timeline.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 22:49:51 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伊朗在其代理人的帮助下策划了更广泛的战争</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/iran-proxies-war-oil.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在短暂的休战期间，伊朗人秘密制定了一项计划，如果美军再次发动攻击，将增加特朗普总统的战争成本。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/iran-proxies-war-oil.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 20:26:35 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普呼吁为布兰奇总检察长之争提供18亿美元资金</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-todd-blanche-weaponization-payouts.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统发誓，如果参议院共和党人未能确认托德·布兰奇担任司法部长，从而重新引发有关和解的争议，他将推动支付基金。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-todd-blanche-weaponization-payouts.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 20:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>以色列称在黎巴嫩关键山顶杀死了几名真主党成员</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/israel-hezbollah-lebanon-killing.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这场在黎巴嫩南部战略山脊上发生的对抗对以色列和伊朗支持的激进组织之间脆弱的停火构成了挑战。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/israel-hezbollah-lebanon-killing.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 20:14:08 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>司法部向自由职业者发出传票，试图查明消息来源</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/times-subpoena-reporter-trump-north-korea.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[此前未公开的传票涉及海豹突击队第六分队在朝鲜执行任务失败的情况，反映出政府正在扩大调查泄密活动。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/times-subpoena-reporter-trump-north-korea.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 16:32:22 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>有证据表明美国向伊朗住宅区投下炸弹，造成3名平民死亡</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/middleeast/us-iran-bomb-mk84-qeshm-island.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[据《泰晤士报》分析，这枚武器是美国武器库中最大的武器之一，击中了人口稠密地区的一所房屋。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/world/middleeast/us-iran-bomb-mk84-qeshm-island.html</guid>
